Material from other projects
============================

Cinnamon (GNU GPL version 2 or later)
-------------------------------------
The Cinnamon shell stylesheet and its accompanying assets in data/themes and
data/template are derived from the Cinnamon 6.6.9 default theme, copyright the
Cinnamon/GNOME Shell contributors, under the GNU General Public License
version 2 or later. Palette colors and additional styling were substituted on
2026-11-10.
Source: https://github.com/linuxmint/cinnamon/tree/master/data/theme

Omarchy, Omacut and Monologue (MIT)
-----------------------------------
The bundled palette data and icon theme names (data/themes/*/palette.json and
manifest.json) are copied from Omarchy 4.5.0, copyright David Heinemeier
Hansson and contributors. src/generator.cpp ports Omarchy's palette fallback
rules and alacritty.toml reader (bin/omarchy-theme-color,
bin/omarchy-theme-colors-from-alacritty) from the same project. The Theme and
Translator source templates are adapted from the Omarchy app templates, Omacut
and Monologue, copyright David Heinemeier Hansson.
