GTK
---
The GTK stylesheet imports the installed GTK 3.24 Adwaita resource at runtime;
GTK itself and the Adwaita resources are not redistributed.

Wallpapers, fonts and icons
---------------------------
No wallpaper, font, icon pack or cursor theme is included in this repository
or in the cinnarchy package. Wallpapers come from an installed Omarchy, from
themes and backgrounds the user downloads, or from the
omarchy-theme-backgrounds package that bin/package-deb builds locally from
Omarchy's own repository. They remain the work of their respective artists.
